{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國型男玄彬與妻子孫藝珍去年在韓國年度影壇盛事《第46屆青龍電影頒獎禮》中齊齊掃走「最佳男、女主角」，又同台捧「人氣明星獎」。</p><p>《第47屆青龍電影頒獎禮》將於下月底舉行，並會率先於下周二舉行打手印儀式。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:23.892016+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:05:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:25.643165+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:25.643165+00:00","content_hash":"7eecbcd1a82bdde8b97900d770079022590cf1ef3606702f5ec2cad59b882892","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}